<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in African club</p>
<p>soccer competitions on Saturday:</p>
<p>Champions' Cup quarter-finals, second leg</p>
<p>In Ibadan: Shooting Stars (Nigeria) 1 Orlando Pirates (South</p>
<p>Africa) 0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Dotun Alatishe (55th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p>Aggregate 1-1. Shooting Stars won 4-3 on penalties.</p>
<p>In Meknes: Omnisports Meknes (Morocco) 2 Zamalek (Egypt) 2</p>
<p>(1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Meknes - Youssef el Mintih (27th), Aballah Belbkri (48th)</p>
<p>Zamalek - Mustapha Tarek (27th), Ayman Mansour (85th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,000</p>
<p>Zamalek win 4-2 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
